        ],
        "text": "The case raises important questions about the scope of arbitrators\u2019 authority over class arbitration, which could affect how courts handle class\u2011action disputes."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Waxman",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a8e26764410c00fea29807778d5de4abd2e1ee53733746b0320d7fba8df313fc",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-a8e26764410c-0002-0007"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 49,
              "start": 49
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The issue is significant because the AAA class\u2011arbitration rules were adopted after the Court\u2019s decision in Bazzle, underscoring ongoing uncertainty about class arbitration."
      }
